s/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9hSVhybF9aemhmdUZWNFJtNlBmQWlFTzNZS2w4bkhIZ1ljUG5BM1RZUEtlWWV3emtQX3diOHVLNW9tVDUzWTI2WVZXMUwxUnpteWR2QkhBd1NPUQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#3</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTFBFbHp0dTVDQ1h2T195MUxKalMzR0lWaWRvNms1YmFpdFFjc0VDZG5aeTVGbVJ3RGZhRlVxb2RjcFFCaFpBa2YyamdoQ2JHaWFtV1dmOWhhT1h3UVNuWFhlbUt6d3FBclUt?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#5</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE5WNzU0cjdDUHVlcXRwZDBFNGdJSklublVaclFRenJ3ZG1zS1pDSVF6Vk9GRVpyZi01NldhZC05NVc5UzBEX3JwbW13eDZZMC1vWTFj?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#6</a>]\n\n<b>5. 미국 연준의 '매파적 동결'과 금리 인상 불확실성</b>\n미국 연방준비제도(Fed)가 금리를 동결했으나, '매파적' 기조를 유지하며 9월 추가 금리 인상 가능성을 시사했습니다. 이에 따라 한국은행의 추가 금리 인상 셈법이 복잡해졌으며, 8월 '백투백 인상설'도 제기되고 있습니다. [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTE5uSnRaMm1UTUFQNW56R242dFRiaFhpcEJrejN1VVlocXAyY2VEVmJldXVSdVZId1NFaERGeEhFQXBVTjc3Vl92S2Q1MGVnYVhMRFliMVRGREFobjd3S2I1RXVKZUVPNmZwSFln?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#19</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE8zY3loSDBVcjRYeUltYms2aFBRMjVOTkU3X3RfWmZ6SjdsdDFhMXVDYWRKWU9rb1F0cnY0TkVXU05vRHRfZDhsZFV0b2o0aml1M2JiU243ZWdKOG5KVDBkLXdQd0hnMnJ0WkE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a>]\n\n개인 투자자 여러분께서는 위 브리핑을 참고하시어 현명한 투자 결정을 내리시길 바랍니다. 감사합니다."}, "curation_at": "2026-07-31 21:44", "market": [{"t": "07-31 21:03", "title": "달러-원, 뉴욕장서 1,440원 초반대 거래", "link": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE5KOUNXd29wWW5WQjBSazREaW9LalNrTzQ3U08tTGdqVk8wc0hIcERZdzlpbmVIWG9OQ3ZJbGhsbGlaQzhiZ1Y3LUhNQXhlMFZwT3pzMjRTQjJhSGlEaTFLMU1NQjRWQ1hkc0tTaUdDT0tCQQ?oc=5", "src": "KB Think", "mk": "kr"}, {"t": "07-31 20:32", "title": "원화로 바꿀 '400억달러' 정체는…고환율 끌어내린 이유 있었다", "link": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE5qZDdTYlZVLUxJSU5fclZnOFBhQkFWb0hXcTNad05mTWFlNzZ1X29JdUZTY3Z2N0h3WEQtS0dIXzFI